        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description><para><b>Model replacement (model skin or face replacement)</b></para>
        /// <para>You provide the original model scene image and the face or reference image of the target model to apply the target person\&quot;s face to the original model. This is suitable for customer-specified models, unified brand images, and character image adaptation for different markets. It also reduces the duplication of using the same model image as other merchants.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para><b>Posture replacement (posture fission)</b></para>
        /// </description></item>
