        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <h2>Product introduction</h2>
        /// <para>Provides a one-click cross-platform product material optimization service (premium edition) for cross-border e-commerce sellers. Accepts a 1688 product link and generates a complete set of materials, including titles, attributes, main images, SKU images, detail images, and copywriting, tailored to TEMU platform requirements.</para>
        /// <h2>Scenarios</h2>
        /// <para>Applicable to scenarios with high requirements for the quality and conversion performance of cross-platform product materials, such as apparel, accessories, beauty, and home categories that heavily rely on marketing materials. Suitable for brand merchants and high-ticket products that need to retain the tone of marketing images with copywriting, top sellers and ERP/SaaS platforms that require localized operations across multiple languages and markets, and scenarios that need to generate category-specific materials (such as size charts and weight and dimension charts) to improve listing quality and conversion rates.</para>
        /// <h2>Features</h2>
