        /// <para>Provides an intelligent cross-platform product category matching service based on large language models. Accepts product information from a source platform, automatically identifies the optimal category on the target platform, and returns a confidence score and matching reasons to help merchants quickly select categories for cross-platform product listing. (Synchronous)</para>
        /// <h2>Scenarios</h2>
        /// <para>Cross-platform product listing: After sourcing products, merchants list them on a target platform and must map the products to the correct categories in the target platform\&quot;s category tree. Manual category selection requires familiarity with the target platform\&quot;s complete category system, which is time-consuming, labor-intensive, and prone to errors. Incorrect category matching can lead to product delisting.
        /// This service automatically completes category mapping and is suitable for scenarios such as batch calls from self-built systems of top sellers, integration of automated product listing workflows into ERP or SaaS platforms, and quick listing of single products by small and medium-sized business (SMB) merchants.
