        /// <para>Users input fields such as the product title, source category, product details, SKU information, and product attributes. The system uses an AI model to understand the product semantics and matches the most appropriate category path from the full category tree of the TEMU platform. The returned results include the complete category path (CategoryPath), category name (CategoryName), confidence score (0-100), and matching reasons. The API operates in synchronous mode and returns results immediately after the call, making it suitable for embedding in real-time business workflows.</para>
