        /// <item><description><b>Multi-platform product information synchronization:</b></description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>When listing products on different e-commerce platforms, merchants can quickly remove specific text and promotional stickers to comply with the image specifications of different platforms.</para>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description><b>Marketing material preparation:</b></description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <para>Merchants can easily remove original promotional information and quickly update it with the latest campaign information.</para>
