        /// <term><b>Summary:</b></term>
        /// <summary>
        /// <para>Audits logistics parcels for compliance in the weight and dimension measurement process of e-commerce logistics by using a multimodal large language model (MLLM) and dedicated visual algorithms. The product performs structured audits on multiple dimensions such as bounding box validity, bounding box fit, and foreign object interference on scanning platforms. It adapts to different hardware capture scenarios such as white and green background boards, and outputs Boolean audit conclusions and reason descriptions in Chinese that can be directly integrated with business systems. It is suitable for large-scale and high-concurrency inbound quality inspection pipelines.</para>
        /// </summary>
        /// 
        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <h2>Product introduction</h2>
        /// <para>Audits logistics parcels for compliance in the weight and dimension measurement process of e-commerce logistics by using a multimodal large language model (MLLM) and dedicated visual algorithms. The product performs structured audits on multiple dimensions such as <b>bounding box validity, bounding box fit, and foreign object interference</b> on scanning platforms. It adapts to different hardware capture scenarios such as white and green background boards, and outputs Boolean audit conclusions and reason descriptions in Chinese that can be directly integrated with business systems. It is suitable for large-scale and high-concurrency inbound quality inspection pipelines.</para>
        /// <h2>Scenarios</h2>
        /// <ol>
        /// <item><description><b>Parcel bounding box audit</b>: Automatically determines whether the manual bounding box drawn by a job operator on a parcel forms a minimum valid border rectangle, and identifies typical issues such as oversized or undersized bounding boxes.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><b>Foreign object interference detection</b>: Automatically identifies whether non-job target objects such as fingers, keyboards, or supporting tools are mixed into the scanning area.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><b>Multi-capture environment adaptation</b>: A single set of APIs can process two common capture patterns: white background boards (blue boxes) and green background boards (blue boxes + red boxes). Callers do not need to distinguish between scenarios.</description></item>
        /// <item><description><b>Inbound quality inspection pipeline</b>: Used for automatic review of the weight and dimension measurement process in the standard operating procedure (SOP) for new product inbound in a logistics repository, to override or assist manual outsourced audits.
        /// In addition, the product is also applicable to general image bounding box-to-subject relationship audit scenarios, such as product photo material audits and document scanning quality verification.</description></item>
        /// </ol>
        /// <h2>Features</h2>
        /// <ol>
