        /// <item><description>Product titles: The Marco MT large language model accurately translates phrases, keywords, and trending words in product titles into the target language to increase product exposure on e-commerce platforms.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Product descriptions: Product descriptions are typically long and have diverse and complex formats. The Marco large language model supports long-text translation and HTML formatting, delivering excellent translation quality and format restoration.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Product attributes: Product attribute terms are short and contain e-commerce-specific words such as models and parameters.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Customer service conversations: In customer service scenarios, the model optimizes issues such as missing context and typos, and supports polite expressions in certain language pairs.
