        /// <item><description><b>Ultra-low hallucination rate and high-speed inference</b>: The Marco MT large language model is a large language model aligned with preferences in translation scenarios. Compared with general-purpose large language models, it provides faster translation inference and an extremely low hallucination rate, making it especially suitable for large-scale invocation scenarios.</description></item>
