        /// <term><b>Summary:</b></term>
        /// <summary>
        /// <para>Translates text by using the Maas-MT model, an e-commerce translation model trained on over 1 billion high-quality bilingual sentence pairs. The model is continuously optimized for e-commerce terminology such as brands, models, materials, and attributes. It supports translation between more than 400 language pairs, including bridged pairs, especially between Chinese and English, Chinese and other languages, and English and other languages. It supports language identification for query phrases in 31 languages and general scenarios in 35 languages. If the source language is not specified, automatic language identification is performed.</para>
        /// </summary>
        /// 
        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <h2>Product introduction</h2>
        /// <para>Maas-MT is an e-commerce translation model trained on over 1 billion high-quality bilingual sentence pairs. It is continuously optimized for e-commerce terminology such as brands, models, materials, and attributes. It supports translation between more than 400 language pairs, including bridged pairs, especially between Chinese and English, Chinese and other languages, and English and other languages. It supports language identification for query phrases in 31 languages and general scenarios in 35 languages. If the source language is not specified, automatic language identification is performed.</para>
        /// <h2>Scenarios</h2>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description>Product titles: The Maas-MT large model can accurately translate phrases, keywords, and trending words in product titles into the target language, increasing product exposure on e-commerce platforms.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Product descriptions: Product descriptions are generally long and have diverse and complex formats. The Maas-MT large model supports long text translation and HTML format, delivering excellent translation quality and format restoration.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Product attributes: Product attribute terms are short and contain e-commerce specific words such as models and parameters.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Customer service conversations: In customer service scenarios, it can optimize issues such as missing context and typos, and supports polite expressions in some language pairs.
        /// In addition, the Maas-MT large model can be used for translation in general scenarios, such as office work, meetings, and daily conversations.</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <h2>Features</h2>
