        /// <term><b>Summary:</b></term>
        /// <summary>
        /// <para>The e-commerce AI video generation agent generates 5- to 30-second product showcase short videos for e-commerce merchants and platforms based on product main images, titles, and selling points, helping customers efficiently produce and distribute e-commerce content. The product supports multiple resolution outputs such as 720P and 1080P, and allows you to quickly invoke single products and generate multiple products in batches, meeting the needs of both daily operations and large-scale product content production. It currently covers all apparel categories (tops, pants, skirts, suits, underwear, swimwear, etc.) and is gradually expanding to core e-commerce categories such as skincare, cosmetics, food and beverages, and home appliances.</para>
        /// </summary>
        /// 
        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <h1>Scenarios</h1>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description>Batch generation of short product videos for sellers and platforms: Supports multiple video aspect ratios and sizes (3:4, 9:16), adapting to scenarios such as product detail page video slots, product homepage displays, information feed placements, short video promotions, and event venue materials.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Quick generation of initial video materials for new product launches: When merchants launch a large number of new products, they only need to upload basic information such as product images and titles to quickly generate product showcase videos, model try-on videos, and voiceover explanation videos. This helps merchants quickly complete material deployment during the launch phase.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>High-fidelity apparel showcase: Generates model showcase videos based on product main images that closely resemble real commercial shooting effects. It focuses on optimizing capabilities such as silhouette restoration, fabric texture retention, accurate color presentation, and stable and consistent details. It supports common e-commerce showcase methods such as try-on, turning, walking, close-up shots, and multi-angle switching.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Generation of high-quality commercial shooting models: Features a built-in target audience model library that covers plus-size women, plus-size men, swimwear, girlish style, light mature commute, youth casual, business menswear, sports and fitness, and other models of various body types, skin colors, and races. It supports various commercial shooting poses such as standing, side profile, walking, and partial close-ups.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>High-frequency e-commerce scenarios such as standard product explanations: Applicable to standardized product categories such as skincare, cosmetics, personal care small appliances, food and beverages, home cleaning and daily necessities, and 3C digital products. It can quickly generate product explanation videos based on product main images, titles, selling point information, and explanation scripts.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Multi-product and multi-selling point testing to improve placement efficiency: For information feed advertising, short video placement, and content promotion scenarios, it can quickly generate multiple versions of video materials. This makes it easy for enterprises to verify the conversion effects of different selling points and presentation forms at a low cost and improve placement ROI.</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <h1>Features</h1>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description>Fully automated end-to-end batch generation with zero prompt threshold: Callers only need to pass in the product image URL and title. The system automatically completes the entire process from product understanding and storyboard planning to video generation, without the need for manual prompt writing, template selection, or repeated parameter tuning. Multiple built-in agents for product understanding, image quality inspection, script planning, and director camera movement greatly lower the barrier to entry.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Highly stable generation with a low waste rate: Adopts a deterministic generation process and multi-layer quality control mechanism to output usable materials with fewer retries. This reduces invalid generation and resource waste, making the overall production cost more controllable.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>E-commerce exclusive product fidelity capability: A built-in multi-round quality inspection agent locks the product state throughout the video generation process (for example, zippers will not be unzipped, sleeves will not be rolled down, and prints will not disappear). It ensures product consistency through multi-layer defense of script rewriting, explicit constraint injection, and failure-aware retry.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Reference image first + 6-axis consistency check: Adopts the reference-image-first generation paradigm, using the original product image as the only visual source of truth. It automatically performs 6-dimensional VL diagnosis (color drift, missing patterns, contour deviation, structure addition or reduction, model matching, and dirt detection) to mechanically eliminate the problem of generated images not looking like the product.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Flexible storyboard arrangement and duration control: Supports an adjustable video duration of 5 to 30 seconds. The agent independently plans storyboards to showcase the product\&quot;s effects in different scenarios. It also supports a fixed scene mode to deeply showcase the product tone under a unified visual style.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Cinematic camera movement capabilities: Features built-in advanced camera movement modes such as bullet time, slow motion, 360° surround rotation, and full-body model rotation showcase. It achieves deterministic output through segmented precise control.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Model library and customization services: Features a built-in multi-type model resource library. It supports merchants in specifying fixed models, customizing exclusive model images, and binding brand visual personas for the long term to ensure brand visual consistency.</description></item>
        /// <item><description>Adaptation to high-frequency e-commerce content scenarios: Supports multiple resolutions such as 720p and 1080p, and multiple aspect ratios such as 3:4 and 9:16. It adapts to product detail page video slots, product homepage video displays, waterfall or information feed placements, event venue materials, and new product and promotional video generation.</description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// </description>
        /// 
        /// <param name="tmpReq">
        /// VideoGenerationRequest
        /// </param>
