        /// <term><b>Summary:</b></term>
        /// <summary>
        /// <para>Generates virtual try-on images by replacing the clothing on a model with a specified garment based on AI algorithms. The service preserves the model\&quot;s details, pose, and facial features while ensuring a realistic and well-fitted appearance. You can obtain processed images by providing the URLs of the original model and garment images.</para>
        /// </summary>
        /// 
        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <para><em>Note:</em>*
        /// VirtualTryOn is an early version that supports only single-garment try-on and is scheduled to be deprecated soon.
