        /// <term><b>Summary:</b></term>
        /// <summary>
        /// <para>Provides a one-stop AI image processing service for e-commerce sellers. This service orchestrates six atomic capabilities into an image processing workflow: element recognition, intelligent cutout, intelligent erasure, image translation Pro, intelligent cropping, and high-definition upscaling. You can upload an image once and select the required capabilities to complete multiple image optimizations in sequence and generate product images that meet e-commerce platform requirements. (Asynchronous)</para>
        /// </summary>
        /// 
        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <h1>1. Product introduction</h1>
        /// <para>Provides a one-stop AI image processing service for e-commerce sellers. This service orchestrates six atomic capabilities into an image processing workflow: element recognition, intelligent cutout, intelligent erasure, image translation Pro, intelligent cropping, and high-definition upscaling. You can upload an image once and select the required capabilities to complete multiple image optimizations in sequence and generate product images that meet e-commerce platform requirements. (Asynchronous)</para>
        /// <h1>2. Scenarios</h1>
        /// <para>Applicable to batch optimization of product images in cross-platform product listing scenarios. It adapts source product images into main images, SKU images, and detail images required by the target platforms. Supported features include:</para>
        /// <list type="bullet">
        /// <item><description><para>Identifying low-quality images with text, watermarks, logos, or cluttered text overlays, and allowing users to filter images for processing.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para>Removing non-compliant elements such as watermarks, logos, cluttered text overlays, and Chinese text from the original image.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para>Removing the background around the main product subject.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para>Translating text in the image into other languages.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para>Expanding the image to other sizes (by aspect ratio or dimensions) and automatically filling the background.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para>Cropping the image to a specified size.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// <item><description><para>Upscaling the image pixels by a specified factor.</para>
        /// </description></item>
        /// </list>
        /// <h1>3. Features</h1>
        /// <para>You can enter the URL of a product image and select the required AI capabilities through the Ability parameter (1=Intelligent element recognition, 2=Intelligent cutout, 3=Intelligent erasure, 4=Image translation Pro, 5=Image expansion, 6=Intelligent cropping, 7=High-definition upscaling). The system executes the selected capabilities in a preset sequence. Because intelligent element recognition helps users determine whether an image contains specific elements, and the presence of these elements affects the selection of subsequent AI capabilities, an additional input option is provided. This option allows users to choose whether to filter out images from subsequent AI processing or retain images without further processing based on the recognition results.
        /// <img src="https://alidocs.oss-cn-zhangjiakou.aliyuncs.com/res/NpQlK5jRe9w5jqDv/img/bddb522a-0795-4b5c-b25d-10e933426367.svg" alt="ai-pipeline-flowchart.svg">
        /// The following section describes each AI capability:
        /// <b>1. Intelligent element recognition</b>: An element detection capability designed specifically for e-commerce images. It can recognize text, logos, watermarks, and text blocks in the subject and background of an image, and return Boolean detection results. You can filter images based on the recognition results (for example, process only images with watermarks) and link this capability with subsequent capabilities. This allows you to identify the types of elements to be optimized before precisely executing operations such as erasure.</para>
        /// <para><b>2. Intelligent cutout</b>: Automatically identifies the main product subject in an image and accurately separates it from the background. Based on deep learning models, it supports precise segmentation of complex edges such as hair and transparent objects. It can output images with transparent or white backgrounds, supports custom background colors and target size cropping, and directly generates product display images that comply with e-commerce platform specifications.</para>
        /// <para><b>3. Intelligent erasure</b>: Automatically identifies and removes non-compliant elements in e-commerce images, such as text, specific names (brand or store names), transparent text blocks, and cluttered text overlays. You can specify whether to remove elements in the subject area or non-subject area. You can also use the Mask parameter to precisely specify the area to be removed, enabling efficient and compliant cleanup of large batches of images.</para>
        /// <para><b>4. Image translation Pro</b>: Integrates multimodal large model technology to translate text in an image into a target language and directly renders it in the corresponding position of the original image. It supports over 100 language pairs. It provides features such as product subject text protection, brand name protection, and translation intervention glossaries to prevent mistranslation of embedded product information. After translation, it can return layout information such as text position, font, and color to support secondary editing.</para>
        /// <para><b>5. Intelligent image expansion</b>: Expands the image canvas based on AI generation technology without cropping the main subject. It supports multiple expansion methods: expanding by aspect ratio (1:1, 3:4, 4:3, 9:16, 16:9), scaling by horizontal or vertical proportion (1.0 to 3.0 times), and shifting pixels in the up, down, left, or right directions. The AI automatically fills and generates naturally transitioning background content.</para>
        /// <para><b>6. Intelligent cropping</b>: Intelligently crops images to a specified size, automatically identifies the main subject area, and accurately retains the core content. It supports custom output width and height (100 to 5000 pixels) and adapts to the image size requirements of different e-commerce platforms and ad slots, ensuring that the subject stands out and the image is balanced after cropping.</para>
        /// <para><b>7. High-definition upscaling</b>: Enhances details and reduces noise while upscaling the image. It supports 2x to 4x upscaling. It is suitable for improving the clarity of low-resolution product images and optimizing visual presentation. It supports output in PNG, JPG, and BMP formats.</para>
        /// <h1>4. Before and after comparison</h1>
        /// <table>
        /// <thead>
        /// <tr>
        /// <th><b>Original image</b></th>
